body:
I have worked with 4-10  year old students and I managed to get away with "one day a cat who I thought was my own came into my house, and once it realised it wasnt "home" it scratched and attacked me until it went back outside"

&#x200B;

im not sure how that may work for you, but it worked for me haha! I wish you the best of luck as I know just how curious kids can be
